	(text "CHANNEL ALLOCATION & I2C ADDRESS TABLE (INA260)\n========================================================================================\nRefDes  | Channel Name | IN+ Net     | IN- Net      | A1 (Pin 4) | A0 (Pin 5) | 7-bit Hex | 8-bit Write\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nU1      | ECU          | ECU         | ECUC         | GND        | GND        | 0x40      | 0x80\nU2      | DASH         | DASH        | DASHC        | GND        | 3.3V       | 0x41      | 0x82\nU3      | PDU          | PDU         | PDUC         | GND        | SDA        | 0x42      | 0x84\nU4      | SDC          | SDC         | SDCC         | GND        | SCL        | 0x43      | 0x86\nU5      | TSAL         | TSAL        | TSALC        | 3.3V       | GND        | 0x44      | 0x88\nU6      | REFRI        | REFRI       | REFRIC       | 3.3V       | 3.3V       | 0x45      | 0x8A\nU7      | BMS          | BMS         | BMSC         | 3.3V       | SDA        | 0x46      | 0x8C\nU8      | TEL          | TEL         | TELC         | 3.3V       | SCL        | 0x47      | 0x8E\nU9      | DV_DIR       | DV_DIR      | DV_DIRC      | SDA        | GND        | 0x48      | 0x90\nU10     | DV_EBS       | DV_EBS      | DV_EBSC      | SDA        | 3.3V       | 0x49      | 0x92\nU11     | DV_GENERAL   | DV_GENERAL  | DV_GENERALC  | SDA        | SDA        | 0x4A      | 0x94\nU12     | DTI          | DTI         | DTIC         | SDA        | SCL        | 0x4B      | 0x96\nU13     | LIDAR        | LIDAR       | LIDARC       | SCL        | GND        | 0x4C      | 0x98\nU14     | LATTEPANDA   | LATTEPANDA  | LATTEPANDAC  | SCL        | 3.3V       | 0x4D      | 0x9A\n--      | [SPARE 1]    | --          | --           | SCL        | SDA        | 0x4E      | 0x9C\n--      | [SPARE 2]    | --          | --           | SCL        | SCL        | 0x4F      | 0x9E\n========================================================================================"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 247.65 163.576 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9e69a759-2baa-4ab4-bdd2-4e4d868bd2de")
	)
	(text "BUCK 12V ELECTRICAL CHARACTERISTICS (TPSM63606EXTRDLR)\n========================================================================================\nPARAMETER                | VALUE            | CONDITIONS / DESIGN DETAILS\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInput Operating Range    | 16.3 V - 36 V    | Nominal: 24 V rail (Abs Max: 42 V)\nInput Turn-On UVLO       | ~16.3 V Rising   | Set by R8 (100k) & R9 (7.5k), ~1.5V internal hysteresis\nRegulated Output Voltage | 12.0 V           | Set by R11 (110k) & R12 (10k) with Vref = 1.0 V\nMax Continuous Current   | 6.0 A            | Rated maximum continuous load capability\nPeak / Saturation Limit  | ~8.5 A - 9.5 A   | Internal high-side cycle-by-cycle peak limit\nMax Continuous Power     | 72 W             | At 12 V / 6.0 A full rated load\nDuty Cycle (Nominal)     | ~50 %            | D = Vout / Vin = 12 V / 24 V\nSwitching Frequency      | ~2.2 MHz         | Set by R10 (6.34k) (*Recommend 400k-600k for thermal margin)\nEfficiency (Nominal)     | ~92 % - 94 %     | At 24 V in, 12 V out @ 4 A - 6 A\nBias Supply Source       | VLDOIN -> VOUT   | Pin 5 tied to 12V output to reduce internal LDO loss\nOutput Capacitance       | 88.1 uF          | 4x 22 uF (C28-C31) + 100 nF HF (C27)\nOutput Voltage Ripple    | < 25 mV pk-pk    | Low-ESR ceramic bank filter response\nInductor Configuration   | Integrated       | Internal shielded power inductor\nThermal Protection       | 165 deg C        | Automatic thermal shutdown with recovery\n========================================================================================"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 339.598 292.354 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "aa390ca1-d235-478b-85eb-89d53c18cf38")
	)
