	(text "BUCK 19V SPECIFICATIONS OVERVIEW\n======================================================\nPARAMETER          | VALUE          | DETAILS / NOTES\n------------------------------------------------------\nInput Voltage Nom  | 24 V           | Nominal DC supply rail\nInput UVLO Rising  | ~20.7 V        | Set by R26 (200k) & R27 (12.7k)\nOutput Voltage     | 18.95 V (~19V) | Set by R31 (137k) & R30 (6.04k)\nMax Output Power   | 90 W           | Supported\nNom Output Current | 4.74 A         | At 90 W / 19 V load\nSwitching Freq     | ~300 kHz       | Set by R28 (33.2k)\nInductor Peak Curr | ~5.4 A         | Requires L1 (10uH) ISAT >= 7A\nCurrent Limit Trip| ~3.7 A - 4.6 A | *Recommend R33 (RILIM) -> 560R\n======================================================"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.126 216.916 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
